# ThreeKingdoms-AgentEngine: Git Ignore Rules
# The Git repository contains ONLY the core engine skeleton, rules, master seed data, and tools.
# All active play sessions, character progress, and database files are isolated locally.

# 1. Playthrough Databases & Saves (Local SQLite sessions & snapshots)
saves/
game/saves/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# 2. Dynamic Playthrough State & Progress (Rendered session projections)
game/PROGRESS.md
game/TURN_STATE.md
game/PLAYER.md
game/RELATIONS.md
game/ledger/
game/chronicle/0184.md
game/military/campaigns.md
game/characters/player.md

# 3. Scratch & Temporary Files
node_modules/
dist/
dist-server/
scratch/
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
